{"title":"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Laura earns <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/f/1af88c1534bab510152766fb60851db0c3a5af52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" />/hour and works <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours per day for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> days. She first spends <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of her pay on food and clothing, and then pays <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/a/18a98e8e7607ccabd3760127117d33e54ac2f446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$350$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"38\" height=\"16\" /> in rent. How much of her pay does she have left?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/2/772cfcbc6995d7692b5678ed372a172dc6e9fddd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\$275 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\$200 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\$350 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\$250 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ \\$300$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"524\" height=\"19\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, we can figure out how much money Laura earned from working.\n</p><p>Since she worked <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/8/a78a1a4b7ed6d64e972454504e74ff3dd218a02b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\frac{hours}{day}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"62\" height=\"43\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/6/6c6c5908e6683f2d9e34bec3adf4860c815a1182.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 \\text{ days}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"17\" />, we know that she worked <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/4/6e46d39e96f32b6f449d22e85a02c72d322e2923.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\frac{hours}{day} \\times 10 \\text{ days} = 80 \\text{ hours}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"228\" height=\"43\" /> in total.\n</p><p>She earned <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/f/08fd6610b95924ecdd2c8885b5918fff8840dba9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\$10}{hour}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"44\" height=\"40\" />, so she was paid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/6/3662d470966c2d0bd724b73abe618c1de1bfe18a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\$10}{hour} \\times 80 \\text { hours} = \\$800$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"191\" height=\"40\" /> in total.\n</p><p>Next, we can figure out how much money of her pay she has left.\n</p><p>She spent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/3/583cd1824b01a9b61eaa8b89c5a6eb6dea0a45bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\% = \\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"69\" height=\"37\" /> of her pay on food and clothing, so she had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/d/bfd498bb281267a29997d213e3ab55d0ee7c37fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - \\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"84\" height=\"38\" /> of her pay remaining after that. \n</p><p>Thus, after spending money on food and clothing, she had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/d/07d62c26d340a1cf4e2ebb1c146f09be14b7a071.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4} \\times \\$800 = \\$600$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"134\" height=\"38\" /> remaining.\n</p><p>She then paid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/a/18a98e8e7607ccabd3760127117d33e54ac2f446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$350$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"38\" height=\"16\" /> in rent. After that, she had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/9/5a94b25e11303ffc34bc5752119ce02e61d2760a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$600 - \\$350 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } \\$250}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"205\" height=\"31\" /> remaining.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 12\">P